 **Formulas:**
 *   **Residual Vector:** For a brood of children $c_1, \dots, c_{2^d}$ and parent $p$, the residual vector $v$ is:
     $$ v = [c_1 - p, c_2 - p, \dots, c_{2^d} - p] $$
